all comply with Applicable Data Protection Laws. The processing of Personal Data for the purposes outlined in Clause 2(ii) of Schedule B is conducted under the sole responsibility of the Processor and the Issuing Banks. Any use of Personal Data for purposes outlined in Clause 2(ii) of Schedule B that breaches the Agreement or Applicable Data Protection Laws, including a failure to ensure compatibility with the original purposes for which the data was collected, shall render the Processor fully liable and obligated to indemnify the Controller for any resulting damages or claims, notwithstanding any limitations of liability under the Agreement.","marks":[{"type":"em"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This was accepted given:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"order":1},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"MQ clearly indicated the purposes it will process the data for - "},{"type":"text","text":"\"improving and developing Marqeta’s products and the services and performing services for Marqeta’s customers generally, including for performing fraud screening and verifying identities and information\"","marks":[{"type":"em"}]},{"type":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"They included full liability for us where they process the data for their own purposes."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The data itself is controlled and processed by the Issuing Bank (cardholder and transaction data) - and MQ has a separate agreement with them allowing them to process this data for this purpose. Bolt has limitations on the purposes it accesses and processes this data, but we still act as a data controller because we have freedom"},{"type":"text","text":" how","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" we process the data."}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[916]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2] Purpose limitation for Bolt & assist MQ with its obligations to Issuing Banks (controllers of credit card and transaction data)","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Bolt`s purposes to use the data under the agreement is limited to the business purposes outlined in the MSA. This limitation is aligned with the product team and stems from the requirements of the Issuing Banks (ultimate controllers of this data), that prohibit the use of credit card and transaction data outside the MSA. MQ enforces this restriction."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Additionally, MQ inserted very general provisions requiring Bolt to assist MQ with its obligations with the Issuing Banks - such as DSRs, supervisory requests, etc. This part was revised by Bolt to be very general - no timelines for support are indicated."}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colwidth":[916]},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3] Limitation of Liability","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":": we were able to negotiate LoL at aggregate 2 million EUR for breaches under the DPA and liability under any indemnity in the MSA (unless LoL specifically excluded). This is X2 the original amount. It took a few rounds of negotiations to reach this. "}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This was accepted given:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"the scope of the service (data subjects are limited to B2B customers; B2C services are out of scope);"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"no special categories of data are processed;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"MQ’s robust security and TOM